416
00:32:46,010 --> 00:32:48,260
I think the eigenvalue
decomposition, and the singular

417
00:32:48,260 --> 00:32:50,070
value decomposition.

418
00:32:50,070 --> 00:32:53,560
Not just for this
course, but pretty much

