581
00:46:35,380 --> 00:46:37,085
What I mean by
hand, I don't really

582
00:46:37,085 --> 00:46:41,000
mean by hand, other than
when you're doing homework.

583
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:44,030
Because you can use
